  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Brentwood, TN\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Brentwood, TN\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBrentwood, TN\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n615.333.1212\n1569 Mallory Ln. Bldg 200\nBrentwood, TN 37027\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nPlease call ahead for availability\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nFor emergency service, please call ahead so we can talk you through your pet’s situation and prepare for your arrival.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving Brentwood, Franklin and central Tennessee.\nOur 24-hour pet hospital is located in Brentwood and serves central Tennessee, including Franklin, Antioch, Brentwood, Columbia, Dixon, Eagleville, Gallatin, Goodlettsville, Hendersonville, Murfreesboro, Nashville, Pegram, Smyrna, Springfield and Spring Hill.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care 24/7 in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary. Learn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment. Learn more about veterinary specialists\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur veterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Brentwood.\nOur BluePearl Pet Hospital in Brentwood offers 24-hour emergency pet medical care in a region where few clinics do.\nWe also continue to add veterinary specialists to provide expert care in a variety of disciplines. Our hospital is equipped with state-of-the-art diagnostic equipment, like a CT scanner, and highly trained veterinarians who offer minimally invasive procedures.\nWe also have a radioiodine I-131 treatment room for cats with hyperthyroidism.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n615.333.1212\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n615.333.1212\n615.661.9883\n1569 Mallory Ln.                                    Bldg 200\nBrentwood,\nTN                                    37027\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nNashville, TN\n2409 21st Ave S\nNashville, TN 37212\n615.383.2600\n10.10 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nLouisville, KY\n13160 Magisterial Dr.\nLouisville, KY 40223\n502.244.3036\n173.45 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBirmingham\nHoover, AL\n3470 Galleria Circle\nHoover, AL 35244\n205.460.2220\n179.58 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
